From ba56b11fdcdeb8f4439fda405f3d3da7315022f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: engine_harness_unreal <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 06:21:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] Brand the app as Engine Harness and keep it apart from
 goose

Product, window, executable and installer names; its own installer id, so it
installs beside goose; auto-updates off until it has its own feed; the system
prompt names Engine Harness and credits goose (snapshots updated); macOS app
menu found by the app's name; configuration under its own GOOSE_PATH_ROOT;
and a NOTICE describing the modification, as the Apache License asks. The
original icons and installer artwork are generated by distro/branding in
engine_harness_unreal and committed by fork.sh.
