+++ b/ENGINE_HARNESS_NOTICE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Engine Harness
+
+Engine Harness is a modified version of [goose](https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose), the open-source agent created by
+AAIF (Agentic AI Foundation), used under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). It is not an official goose release and
+is not endorsed by AAIF.
+
+The modifications live as a patch queue in https://github.com/mkiem/engine_harness_unreal (`distro/patches`), applied
+to the goose release pinned in `distro/goose.lock.json`. They:
+
+- bundle game-development extensions (Game Harness, Blender) and add game-development guidance to the system prompt;
+- ship the Engine Harness payload in `resources/harness` and a `harness-mcp` launcher (`ui/desktop/src/utils/harnessLauncher.ts`);
+- rename the app to Engine Harness, with original icons and installer artwork, its own installer id, and auto-updates off;
+- keep its configuration apart from goose's (`GOOSE_PATH_ROOT` in the app's data folder).
+
+Each modified file is listed in the patches; `git log v1.57.0..studio` in the fork shows them.
